<title>SPAIN: TENNIS-MARBELLA WORLD SERIES QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MARBELLA WORLD SERIES QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MARBELLA, Spain 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in the Marbella world series men's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Marc Goellner (Germany) beat Fernando Vicente (Spain) 7-5 6-1</p>
<p>4-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) 7-5 6-1</p>
<p>2-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Christian Ruud (Norway) 0-6 7-6 (7-2) 6-3</p>
<p>Bernd Karbacher (Germany) beat Marcos Aurelio Gorriz (Spain) 6-3 2-6 6-4.</p>
</text>
